<title>UK: Unichem jumps as results impress.</title>
<headline>Unichem jumps as results impress.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Unichem Plc jumped to a two-month after the UK drug wholesaler and retailer posted results that exceeded most analysts' forecasts, dealers said.</p>
<p>At 1238 GMT, the shares were up 12p to 260p.  </p>
<p>The rest of the sector was flat to lower, with Amersham International Plc tumbling 17-1/2p to 1210, despite an</p>
<p>Earlier, Unichem said its pre-tax pre-exceptional profits rose to 53.5 million stg in the year ended December 31, 1996.</p>
